Evaluate the impact of recent geopolitical events and international relations on the S&P 500. Analyze the potential risks and opportunities arising from these events, such as trade wars, political instability, or international conflicts. Consider sectors, e.g. what events may benefit or be negative to oil or energy. A heightened risk level should lean you toward bearish sentiment, while resolving these tensions may encourage a bullish sentiment. Adjust conviction depending on your confidence in forecasting the impact of these events.